*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0012.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0012C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 ACCT-STAT-CD       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM 4100-TO-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STAT-CD=" ACCT-STAT-CD
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 4 AND DAYS-LATE > 30
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
        ADD 50 TO LATE-FEE
    END-IF.
4100-TO-COLLECTIONS.
    IF DAYS-LATE > 90
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
    END-IF.
